# Release build artifacts. The .github/scripts/build-*.sh scripts default
# OUT_DIR to the repo root, so a local `bun run build:tarball` (or any of the
# release:* scripts) drops the built assets beside the source, where they sit
# as untracked noise that `git add -A` would cheerfully commit into the next
# commit. The release workflows upload these by path, so ignoring them here
# does not affect publishing.
#
# Anchored to the repo root so a same-named fixture under a subdirectory stays
# committable. The trailing `*` covers both the asset and its `.sha256`
# sidecar, and covers new architectures without another edit here.
/browser-bridge-*-v*
